-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",407,{
[12993]="7000D787\n1\tTalk to Nethraw\tNethraw is at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. Nethraw has asked you to gather allies and accompany him into the Krúsle Lannan.\n2\tNethraw is at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. Nethraw has asked you to accompany him into the Krúsle Lannan.\t\n3\tTalk to Nethraw\030Collect The Seven Swords\tNethraw is at the Krúslë Lannan, east of Gabilshathûr. You should speak again with Nethraw.\n",
[12994]="7003EA7E\n1\tTear down what remains of the White Hand's banners (total: 12)\tWhite Hand banners can be found inside the ring of Isengard as well as throughout Nan Curunír. You have found the tattered remains of banners of the once-imposing White Hand. You should destroy them and end Saruman's violent legacy.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed what remained of the White Hand's banners.\n",
[12995]="700001E0\n1\tTalk to Elrond\tElrond can be found at Rivendell in the Trollshaws to the south and east of the North Downs. Istuienn told you to take the morgul-hilts to Elrond Halfelven to be destroyed.\n2\tBring the morgul-hilts to Hemeldir\tHemeldir can be found at the Forges of Rivendell outside the Halls of Elrond. Elrond told you to take the morgul-hilts to his chief smith, Hemeldir.\n",
[12996]="700529CC\n1\tComplete 'Instance: The Shadow Hunter'\tThe time has come to enter Shathur-munzu. You should complete 'Instance: The Shadow Hunter.'\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n3\tFind Baradal\tBaradal is somewhere inside Shathur-munzu. She may be in danger. You should find Baradal.\n4\tAttempt to break the lock\tBaradal is locked inside a cage in Shathur-munzu, injured and in danger. You should attempt to break open her cage.\n5\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n6\tDefeat the Orc jailor\030Acquire the crude iron key\tSomewhere inside Shathur-munzu, an Orc holds the key to Baradal's cage. You should find and defeat the Orc jailor.\n7\tOpen the strong lock\tNow that you have the key, you should return to Baradal's cage and try to open it.\n8\tTalk to Baradal\tBaradal has been freed from her cage. You should talk to Baradal.\n",
[12997]="70025B6B\n1\tCollect Orders (total: 4)\tTham Ornen is north east of Tinnudir. Nadfaron asked you to venture to Tham Ornen and gather orders from the Angmarim camp.\n2\tTalk to Nadfaron\tNadfaron is at Tinnudir, south west of Tham Ornen. Nadfaron will be eager to examine the orders you found at the Angmarim camp in Tham Ornen.\n",
[12998]="70054004\n1\tTalk to Lethi\tLethi can be found in the dungeons of Barad-dûr. The Stout-axes have begun to revolt within the Dark Tower. You should talk to Lethi.\n2\tTalk to Dwalin in Thorin's Hall\tDwalin can be found in Thorin's Hall. You have spent many months helping to undo the damage wrought upon Thorin's Halls by the Dourhands. You should speak to Dwalin.\n",
[12999]="700490DE\n1\tEnter Barad-dûr\tBarad-dûr is located in eastern Dor Amarth. You should enter Barad-dûr.\n2\tFollow the trail of scratch marks\tNarchraw was said to be imprisoned in the jails of Barad-dûr. You should follow the trail of scratch marks.\n3\tExamine the rubble\030Examine the tattered cloth\030Examine the food scraps\tThe chamber is scattered with debris. You should inspect the various debris in the chamber.\n4\tCompleted\tExamined the chamber.\n",
[13000]="7003E2FE\n1\tDefeat barghests in the western Fields of Fornost (total: 10)\tBarghests can be found in the western Fields of Fornost. You should defeat barghests in the Fields of Fornost.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many barghests in the western Fields of Fornost.\n",
[13001]="7005766A\n1\tReturn to the Crown Chamber\tThe Shadowed King must be found and defeated, but first, you must find Frethi. You should return to the Crown Chamber in the Foundations of Stone.\n2\tInspect the note from Frethi\tFrethi has left you a note in the Crown Chamber. You should read the note.\n3\tFind Frethi near the Shadowed Cave\tFrethi left you a note saying he had gone to investigate the Shadowed Cave. You should find the Shadowed Cave in the Foundations of Stone.\n4\tComplete Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows\tThe Shadowed King awaits within the Shadowed Cave. You should complete Askâd-mazal, the Chamber of Shadows, on any difficulty.\n5\tTalk to King Thorin\tThe Shadowed King has been vanquished! You should return to King Thorin and inform him of your victory.\n",
[13002]="7003FFFF\n1\tSearch Tarlang's Crown for the missing hunters\tThe missing hunters can be found somewhere along the road through Tarlang's Crown. Gordir has grown worried about two hunters that ventured into Tarlang's Crown and has asked you to seek them out.\n2\tSearch Tarlang's Crown for the other missing hunter\tThe other hunter can likely be found further along the road into Tarlang's Crown. You have discovered the remains of one of the hunters, but it is possible the other survived. You should search for them.\n3\tPatrol the road deeper into Tarlang's Crown\tThe road through Tarlang's Crown can be found to the south of Sardol in Blackroot Vale. Having found both hunters slain, you hope to find out what brought about their demise in Tarlang's Crown.\n4\tTalk to Gordir\tGordir can be found on the dock on the river Blackroot to the west of Sardol. You have found the remains of two hunters from Sardol and evidence of a massing corsair force in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[13003]="70037C87\n1\tSearch the hill to the north-east of the Fords\030Search the hill to the south-east of the Fords\tGrimbold can likely be found near the Fords of Isen. You should search around the Fords of Isen for signs of Grimbold.\n2\tSearch for Grimbold at the river crossing\tGrimbold can possibly be found at the Fords of Isen, where the stones make paths across the river. You should search the Fords of Isen for Grimbold.\n3\tFind Grimbold at the fords\tGrimbold can likely be found somewhere at the Fords of Isen in the far west of the Westfold. You should search for Grimold.\n",
[13004]="700006AC\n1\tBring the darkwater-swords to Aric the Stone-speaker\030Collect darkwater-swords (total: 15)\tDarkwater can be found throughout Agamaur and Garth Agarwen, far to the north. Aric the Stonespeaker wishes to help the cursed men of Arthedain and has asked you to banish the darkwater found in Agamaur. He has also asked you to bring back their swords for him to display, to bolster the flagging spirits of the cursed men.\n",
[13005]="70049426\n1\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth. You should talk to Thurindol.\n2\tScout Dâr Mauzur\030Scout the southern end of Fushaum Bal\030Scout the northern end of Fushaum Bal\030Complete quests in Fushaum Bal\tDâr Mauzur and Fushaum Bal can be found in Talath Úrui. You should scout these locations for Thurindol.\n3\tTalk to Thurindol\tThurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth. You should speak with Thurindol.\n",
[13006]="7002F97C\n1\tTalk to Ides\tIdes can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts. Ides would like you to accompany her and to provide assistance in her training venture.\n2\tTalk to Ides\tIdes can be found training at the mill, north of the Rohirrim training grounds, at the northern edge of the Norcrofts. Ides wishes to speak with you following your dangerous training excursion.\n",
[13007]="7004295A\n1\tLiberated ship-slaves ([see journal]/6)\030Quest will finish on Corsair defeat.\tFind and free ship-slaves who are manacled throughout the area.\n",
[13008]="70066892\n1\tPlace the pack on the table\tLúmar has asked you to search through the shredded pack that you found for any information that might tie it to Igerna. You can search through the pack on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndir.\n2\tSearch the pack\tYou should search through the pack for clues. The pack is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.\n3\tContinue searching the pack\tYou should continue searching through the pack for clues. The pack is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.\n4\tRead the hastily scrawled note\tWhile searching through Igerna's pack, you found a hastily scrawled note addressed to Lúmar. You should read the note. The note is on the table next to Lúmar, in Ost Arndír.\n5\tSpeak to Lúmar\tLúmar is waiting to speak with you about what was written on the note you found. Lúmar is in Ost Arndír.\n",
[13009]="7006EEDE\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Iridír.\n",
[13010]="7001627C\n1\tBring an infused sapphire to Perimbant\tPerimbant has asked you to bring him an infused sapphire which may allow your weapon to be imbued with an Elven quality. Where you may find such a sapphire, the Elf does not know.\n2\tTalk to Perimbant to travel to Barad Morlas\tPerimbant can be found at Echad Dúnann, west of the gates of Moria. Perimbant has bidden you to speak with him when you are ready to travel to Barad Morlas, where a company of Elves has been entrapped by an army of Dunlendings from the south.\n3\tBring the empowered sapphire to Perimbant\tPerimbant can be found at Echad Dúnann, west of the gates of Moria. You should return to Perimbant to complete the enhancement of your weapon.\n",
[13011]="70071620\n1\tComplete 'Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl'\tMizâdi's allied forces are in place. You must now infiltrate the city with Razâl and open the gates to Emax Dûl. Talk to Razâl at Mizâdi's hidden camp, Nashûbu, and complete 'Instance: The Siege of Emax Dûl'.\n2\tTalk to Mizâdi\tMizâdi's forces now have a foothold of control in Emax Dûl, but Góramul Sai and Bârshud have escaped. You should talk to Mizâdi outside of Emax Dûl's palace, Ekal-nêbi.\n",
[13012]="7001A76E\n1\tReport to Mathi, commander of Gondamon\tMathi has been leading the defence of Gondamon for the duration of the siege. It is crucial for you to report in to him and find out where you can help.\n2\tPush back the first assault\tThe first assault of the final attack has begun. The Enemy must not breach the walls.\n3\tPush back the second assault\tThe second assault of the final attack has begun. The Enemy is attempting to force their way in through a different gate.\n4\tPush back the third assault\tThe third assault of the final attack has begun. They are attempting to come through the last gate.\n5\tFend off the final assault\tThe final assault has begun. Their numbers are waning, but their ferocity increasing. Withstand this storm, defeat their leader, and Gondamon will continue to stand free.\n",
[13013]="70043009\n1\tFind the shaded path that overlooks the River Erui\030Find the Erui overlook, south-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand\030Find the bridge by the source of the Erui, north-west of Imloth Melui\030Find the tall stone steps in the north\030Find the central fountain\tLady Vanyalos has asked you to appreciate the many beautiful sights within Imloth Melui.\n2\tReturn to Lady Vanyalos in her hall\tLady Vanyalos is in her hall on the north-east rise of Imloth Melui, waiting for you to return with descriptions of her city.\n",
[13014]="7007161B\n1\tTalk to Unusâli\030Talk to Sorkamâl the Forbearing\030Talk to Hidâti\tCaptain Hanâbu has asked for your getting his soldiers out of Esh Mêkag, the Silent Mouth. You should talk to your allies before you depart.\n2\tFind Arâniz outside Esh Mêkag\tCaptain Hanâbu has sent you to find his scout, Arâniz. You should find him hidden somewhere outside the prison, Esh Mêkag.\n",
[13015]="7004A8CF\n1\tThe Silent One can likely be found off the road to the south of Durthang with the slain Orcs he took from Durthang. A dying Uruk has asked you to kill the Silent One, an Orc who has seemingly aligned himself with the spiders of Lhingris.\t\n2\tTalk to Legolas at the ruined encampment\tLegolas can be found at the ruined encampment in northern Lhingris. You found the Silent One's victims presented as some kind of offering to the spiders of Lhingris before the Silent One attacked you and fled back into the shadows. You should return to Legolas.\n",
[13016]="70044F89\n1\tSearch for Beregond in Rath Dínen\tYou should search Rath Dínen for signs of Beregond. Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, is the final resting place for the Kings and Stewards of Gondor.\n2\tConfront and defeat the Withered Tree\tYou should confront and defeat the members of the Withered Tree that have come to depose the Steward.\n3\tDefeat the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor\tYou should return the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor to rest before pursuing the Gloom of Nurn.\n4\tDefeat the Gloom of Nurn\tYou must defeat the Gloom of Nurn before he can claim the crown of the King for Gothmog.\n",
[13017]="70044F8A\n1\tSearch for Beregond in Rath Dínen\tYou should search Rath Dínen for signs of Beregond. Rath Dínen, the Silent Street, is the final resting place for the Kings and Stewards of Gondor.\n2\tConfront and defeat the Withered Tree\tYou should confront and defeat the members of the Withered Tree that have come to depose the Steward.\n3\tDefeat the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor\tYou should return the risen Kings and Stewards of Gondor to rest before pursuing the Gloom of Nurn.\n4\tDefeat the Gloom of Nurn\tYou must defeat the Gloom of Nurn before he can claim the crown of the King for Gothmog.\n",
[13018]="7004AB9C\n1\tComplete Kála-murg: The Silken Gift\tCandúr can be found in Udûn. You should talk Candúr.\n2\tCompleted\tCompleted Kála-murg: The Silken Gift.\n",
[13019]="700559A5\n1\tDefeat Girwael\tGirwael can be found at Celeband upon the Circle of Despair. You should defeat Girwael.\n2\tDefeat Girwael\tGirwael can be found at Celeband upon the Circle of Despair. You should defeat Girwael.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Girwael.\n",
[13020]="7004185B\n1\tTell Melawen the story of your encounter with Roamingstar\030Tell Lendithil the story of your encounter with Roamingstar\tMelawen and Lendithil can be found in Malbarth. Arvaeth has asked you to tell the people of Malbarth of your supposed meeting with the fabled Sister of the Gilrain.\n2\tTalk to Arvaeth by the Gilrain\tArvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth in Lebennin. You have told the folk of Malbarth and should now return to Arvaeth near the banks of the Gilrain.\n3\tDisturb the pile of river-stones\tThe pile of river-stones can be found on the banks of the Gilrain to the north-west of Malbarth. Arvaeth has asked you to disturb the pile of river-stones in an attempt to draw Roamingstar forth once more.\n4\tTalk to Arvaeth\tArvaeth can be found to the north-west of Malbarth along the banks of the Gilrain in Lebennin. Roamingstar did not come to the river's edge. You should speak to Arvaeth about what is to be done.\n5\tTalk to Barchir in Malbarth\tBarchir can be found in Malbarth in western Lebennin. Although you could not call Roamingstar forth, Arvaeth still believes your tale. You should return to Barchir.\n",
[13021]="7004CE31\n1\tFind the murder location\tThe murder location can be found somewhere in central Lake-town. You should find the murder location.\n2\tTalk to one of the guards at the murder location\tThe murder location can be found somewhere in central Lake-town. You should talk to one of the guards at the location of the murder.\n3\tThe location of the murder can be found somewhere in central Lake-town. You should investigate the murder location.\t\n4\tTalk to one of the guards at the murder location\tThe location of the murder can be found somewhere in central Lake-town. You should talk to one of the guards at the murder location.\n5\tTalk to Mervárth\tThe murder investigation is complete. You should talk to Mervárth.\n",
[13022]="7001EE00\n1\tCollect Relics of Necromancy (total: 15)\tThe Relics of Necromancy can be retrieved from Sammath Gûl and should be returned to Laegalar in Helethir. You should go to Sammath Gûl and retrieve the relics of Necromancy used by the Black Númenóreans there.\n",
[13023]="7005CC7E\n1\tSearch for Nâtatharr\tNâtatharr is in eastern Clovengap. You should search for Nâtatharr.\n2\tTalk to Gerja in Bazanmanar\tGerja Defthand is at Bazanmanar, in north-east Clovengap. You should let Gerja Defthand know that you found Nâtatharr.\n",
[13024]="7000AE51\n1\tExamine Billina\tBillina is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should try to find out what is wrong with Billina. She is quite an intelligent chicken.\n2\tExamine Billina\tBillina is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should check on Billina.\n3\tTalk to Wald Sandson\tWald Sandson is in the yard at Sandson's Farm. You should return to Wald Sandson and tell him of your success.\n",
})
